# Cloudflare Pages headers — https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
# Hardening del panel admin.
#
# CSP ENFORCED (bloquea, no solo reporta). Verificada: superficie de login sin
# violaciones (headless) + análisis estático de app.js. Se añadió www.google.com
# a script-src/connect-src de forma preventiva por si Firebase Auth dispara
# reCAPTCHA en el login (carga recaptcha desde www.google.com); gstatic ya estaba.
#
# Inventario que cubre cada directiva:
#   script-src   app.js local + SDK Firebase (gstatic) + gapi (apis.google.com)
#                + www.google.com (reCAPTCHA de Firebase Auth, defensivo)
#   connect-src  Cloud Functions admin + auth REST (identitytoolkit/securetoken/
#                googleapis) + www.google.com (verificación reCAPTCHA, defensivo)
#   img-src      assets locales + fotos de comercios (Firebase Storage)
#   frame-src    iframe auth de Firebase (authDomain) + embed de Maps
#                (maps.google.com hace 301 a www.google.com/maps) + reCAPTCHA
#   style-src    'unsafe-inline' por el <style> del propio index.html
#
# Si tras un cambio el panel deja de cargar algo, revisar la consola: una línea
# "Refused to… because it violates… Content Security Policy" indica el origen
# que falta añadir.

/admin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' https://www.gstatic.com https://apis.google.com https://www.google.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com; connect-src 'self' https://us-central1-eatout-70b8b.cloudfunctions.net https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com https://securetoken.googleapis.com https://www.googleapis.com https://apis.google.com https://www.google.com; frame-src https://eatout-70b8b.firebaseapp.com https://maps.google.com https://www.google.com; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'

/admin/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' https://www.gstatic.com https://apis.google.com https://www.google.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com; connect-src 'self' https://us-central1-eatout-70b8b.cloudfunctions.net https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com https://securetoken.googleapis.com https://www.googleapis.com https://apis.google.com https://www.google.com; frame-src https://eatout-70b8b.firebaseapp.com https://maps.google.com https://www.google.com; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
